# cmd.exe cannot parse a batch file with Unix line endings: it runs the
# comment lines as commands. That is not a style preference, it is the
# difference between the update agent working and every till going quiet,
# which is exactly what happened once a git-normalised LF copy of check.cmd
# reached the hub share.
#
# These files are checked out and committed with CRLF on every platform.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
